'''Sagh's Refuge'''<ref>[[Patch 1.18.1#CLASSIC ZONE EDITS]]</ref> is the home of the tauren [[Sagh]], located in the [[Thousand Needles]]. It has become the refuge of survivors of the [[Windhorn tribe]] who have fled their home of [[Windhorn Canyon]] when it was attacked by the [[Grimtotem clan|Grimtotem]] of the [[Blackwind]].

